# The repository root ignores every `lib/` and `var/` directory and every
# `*.so`. These paths hold synthetic host files that the collector tests read
# (the Geekbench record and the KSM opt-in shim marker), so they must be tracked
# or a clean checkout collects different facts than a developer tree.
!lib/
!var/
!usr/lib/fleetd/ksm-optin.so
